{"word":"κατάλυσις","uri":"katalusis","senses":[{"word":"κατάλυσις","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">κατάλυσις,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">εως</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>) [<span class=\"grec\">ῠ</span>]\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> action de dissoudre,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> action de congédier,\nlicenciement : <span class=\"grec\">στρατιᾶς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 1, 13,</span> d’une armée ; <span class=\"grec\">τριήρους,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1209, 24,</span> de l’équipage d’une trirème ; <span class=\"grec\">εἰς κατάλυσιν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 12,</span>\njusqu’à ce que les hommes soient congédiés (après une revue)\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> dissolution, ruine,\nrenversement, destruction (d’un gouvernement, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 18 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 1, 45 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">864</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> achèvement, terminaison,\nfin (d’un repas, d’une guerre, de la vie) <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 18 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 8, 1 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 102, 6</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> action de délier (un\nattelage <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> des bagages) <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> s